sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as authService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    C->>S: POST /auth/login (email, password)
    S->>DB: verify bcrypt hash
    S->>DB: create Session (refreshTokenHash)
    S-->>C: accessToken (15m) and refreshToken

    Note over C,S: access token expires

    C->>S: POST /auth/refresh (refreshToken)
    S->>DB: find Session by hash(refreshToken)
    alt hash mismatch, reuse or stolen token
        S->>DB: revoke ALL sessions for user
        S-->>C: 401 reuse detected, please login again
    else valid
        S->>DB: rotate refreshTokenHash, extend expiry
        S-->>C: new accessToken and refreshToken
    end
